{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22159","headline":"闻庾七左降因咏所怀 · 白居易","name":"闻庾七左降因咏所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我病卧渭北，君老谪巴东。\n相悲一长叹，薄命与君同。\n既叹还自哂，哂叹两未终。\n後心诮前意，所见何迷蒙。\n人生大块间，如鸿毛在风。\n或飘青云上，或落泥涂中。\n衮服相天下，傥来非我通。\n布衣委草莽，偶去非吾穷。\n外物不可必，中怀须自空。\n无令怏怏气，留滞在心胸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}